const managementAccess = "Internal application business API. Requires an active verified cookie session and the effective actor's current active company membership with the operation permission stated below (owners/managers have these management capabilities). Platform authority alone, staff property access and occupant status grant no financial authority. IDs and optional X-Company-ID are untrusted; the latter is an opening-company fence, never a company selector. The scoped serializable transaction rechecks membership, features, support context and company RLS. Authorized support views can read the target's permitted records; every financial write, including POST previews, is denied while impersonating. Finances and leasing features apply; reports instead require reports+finances, and expense imports additionally require properties.";
